	<ideo>
		<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
			<def>Deity</def>
			<place>Sophiamunda</place>
			<deities>
				<li>
					<name>A Primeira Voz</name>
					<type>Fundadora do Coro</type>
					<gender>Female</gender>
					<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
				</li>
				<li>
					<name>O Eco Imperial</name>
					<type>Memória do Império Caído</type>
					<gender>Male</gender>
					<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
				</li>
			</deities>
		</foundation>
		<name>A Harmonia Superior</name>
		<adjective>coral</adjective>
		<memberName>cantor</memberName>
		<leaderTitleMale>Maestro Supremo</leaderTitleMale>
		<leaderTitleFemale>Maestrina Suprema</leaderTitleFemale>
		<description>Na Queda, todas as armas falharam, menos a mente. Os herdeiros do antigo Império cantam em uníssono psíquico, e quem rege o coro é sempre a voz mais poderosa. Títulos passam de pai para filho, porque o talento, como a nobreza, está no sangue.

Toda mente é uma voz, e a maioria desafina. Os vassalos pagam o dízimo do Coro: impostos, cerimônias intermináveis e as crianças mais sensíveis, levadas para "treinamento vocal". Poucas voltam, mas todas afinadas.</description>
		<descriptionTemplate>Our founder Crisóstomo jirade was a psychic warrior in a forgotten, shattered star empire. Ele had an incredible mental discipline, that manifested in wondrous psychic powers. Ele founded a prestigious martial academy where all dele followers could learn how to hone their minds and use them as a weapon. Jirade's followers studied o writings and created a social structure that has been stable for more than two hundred years.</descriptionTemplate>
		<descriptionLocked>True</descriptionLocked>
		<culture>Sophian</culture>
		<iconDef>AbstractsC</iconDef>
		<colorDef>DarkSapphire</colorDef>
		<memes>
			<li>VME_Structure_CultOfPersonality</li>
			<li>VME_PsychicFocus</li>
			<li>VME_Aristocratic</li>
			<li>EQ_Meme_PsychicChoir</li>
		</memes>
